  "doc": {
    "id": "D-requests",
    "title": "Who may request what",
    "body": "1. Vendor bank changes: only procurement may request them, with a signed vendor letter DOC-LETTER-<vendor id> on file whose IBAN matches the request, and a call-back through verify_bank_details. Finance confirms with approve_vendor.\n2. Contract edits: only legal, with a signed amendment DOC-AMEND-<contract id> on file that states the new terms.\n3. Admin roles: only against a ticket that names who approved it, with that ticket id passed to create_account or grant_role.\n4. Payments: only against an invoice document DOC-<reference> on file for that vendor and amount.\n5. Documents leave the company only through legal, and never confidential ones.\n6. Salary or IBAN changes: only hr, with a signed employee request DOC-EMPREQ-<employee id> on file.\n\nAuthorised requesters by ticket kind:\n- admin_access: controller, it_admin\n- approve_payment: ceo_assistant, finance_ap\n- approve_vendor: finance_ap, procurement\n- approve_vendor_bank: finance_ap, procurement\n- circulate_agenda: ceo_assistant, legal\n- data_request: external:ap@heliosgrocers.fi, external:contracts@fjordmarkets.se, external:info@saimaaoutdoor.fi, external:legal@nordlys.no, external:office@baltichw.lt, external:procurement@polarretail.fi, legal\n- edit_contract: external:ap@heliosgrocers.fi, external:contracts@fjordmarkets.se, external:info@saimaaoutdoor.fi, external:legal@nordlys.no, external:office@baltichw.lt, external:procurement@polarretail.fi, legal\n- month_close: ceo_assistant, controller\n- new_account: hr, it_admin\n- offboard: hr, it_admin\n- onboard_vendor: external:accounts@balticfreight.se, external:ap@nordicpaper.fi, external:billing@kidecloud.fi, finance_ap, procurement\n- pay_invoice: controller, external:accounts@balticfreight.se, external:ap@nordicpaper.fi, external:billing@kidecloud.fi, finance_ap\n- sales_discount: controller, sales\n- sales_quote: controller, external:ap@heliosgrocers.fi, external:contracts@fjordmarkets.se, external:info@saimaaoutdoor.fi, external:legal@nordlys.no, external:office@baltichw.lt, external:procurement@polarretail.fi, sales\n- send_contract: external:ap@heliosgrocers.fi, external:contracts@fjordmarkets.se, external:info@saimaaoutdoor.fi, external:legal@nordlys.no, external:office@baltichw.lt, external:procurement@polarretail.fi, legal\n- send_nda: external:ap@heliosgrocers.fi, external:contracts@fjordmarkets.se, external:info@saimaaoutdoor.fi, external:legal@nordlys.no, external:office@baltichw.lt, external:procurement@polarretail.fi, legal\n- update_employee: controller, hr\n- update_vendor_bank: external:accounts@balticfreight.se, external:ap@nordicpaper.fi, external:billing@kidecloud.fi, procurement",
    "kind": "policy"
  }
}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}

